// Crater application icon. Embedded into crater.exe by the Windows resource
// compiler — visible to File Explorer, Programs & Features (via the .iss's
// UninstallDisplayIcon={app}\crater.exe directive), Start menu / desktop
// shortcuts, and the taskbar before the QML engine takes over. The runtime
// icon for QML windows is set via QApplication::setWindowIcon() in main.cpp
// using the qrc-bundled copy at qrc:/brand/crater.ico — same source asset,
// loaded a different way so parity holds across platforms (the .rc only
// runs through Windows' resource compiler; macOS / Linux pick up the qrc
// path from setWindowIcon).
//
// Resource id `1` (numeric, not the named `IDI_APPLICATION` constant) is
// intentional: Windows picks the icon resource with the alphabetically-
// lowest numeric id as the .exe's file-icon. Using `1` keeps us the
// lowest no matter what any future-linked library tries to add.
1 ICON "crater.ico"
